<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglogold says two die in mine rock fall.</title>
<headline>Anglogold says two die in mine rock fall.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd unit Anglogold said on Thursday that two miners had died in a rockfall at its Vaal Reefs Ltd No. 2 shaft.</p>
<p>The accident, caused by a seismic event, ocurred on 68 level about 2,010 metres below the surface at about 1915 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
